    <div class="alpheios-lex-entry" lemma-id="n46798" body-key=""><b><span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ἤκεστος</span></b> , <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">η</span>, <span class="alpheios-lex-greek" lang="grc">ον</span>, (
